    "updated_at": "2024-11-27T09:21:00Z",
    "body": "From an abstract point of view it's surprising that \"inform the navigation API about aborting navigation\" doesn't inform in that case. It's also not obvious if it does nothing. It seems it might also queue a task (which might do nothing).\r\nSo it'd be clearer to not invoke that step.",
